  Same shape and the same reason as the activity icons beside it: a translated
  group rather than a rewritten path, and a file of its own rather than
  material-icons-extended, which ships every unused icon given
  isMinifyEnabled = false (§6.3) — see Appendix A.11. `Icons.Filled` has no
  upward arrow; the core icon set is deliberately small.

  This one is not an activity. It marks a recording that is near the top of its
  route's range (A.21), where colour and weight alone were too quiet to find by
  scanning once the threshold moved to the 85th percentile.
-->
